# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Gifts Studio: local layout, order and per-gift tweaks for the profile Gifts tab.

How it works: the profile gifts list is a RecyclerView inside ProfileGiftsContainer.
Sorting and filtering are done in a hook on its fillItems(), which builds the adapter items.
Columns, sizes and effects are applied to the visible cells by a timer, because cells are
recycled while scrolling. Nothing is written to the server, all state lives in plugin settings.
"""
import json
import math
import random
